notebook-local
==============

This package wraps (does not modify) the following open-source software:

  kordoc — https://github.com/chrisryugj/kordoc
  Copyright (c) chrisryugj. Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE-kordoc).
  Installed unmodified from npm (kordoc ^4.17) for document parsing/OCR.

Design inspired by Google NotebookLM (no code shared). Embedding model (e.g. BAAI bge-m3, MIT) and
TTS server (e.g. Kokoro, Apache-2.0) are external services configured by environment variables.

Files authored for this package (MIT):
  app.py, ui.html, goal-prompt.md, selftest.py, setup.sh, pack.sh, README.md

LLM (not bundled): called via an OpenAI-compatible API; default deployment is Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, MIT)
  serving Google Gemma (gemma4:31b, https://ai.google.dev/gemma — see Gemma's terms of use).

